02:46:03.359 --> 02:46:07.920
The Foundation didn’t know how, but&nbsp;
the silck-ness was starting to spread,&nbsp;&nbsp;

02:46:07.920 --> 02:46:11.939
with people’s abilities to write&nbsp;
