02:46:11.939 --> 02:46:16.740
That’s when a Foundation webtrawler&nbsp;
pick up seemthing even more dousturbing:&nbsp;&nbsp;

02:46:16.740 --> 02:46:23.219
Global literacy seemed to be taking a dive. The&nbsp;
